    "line": 674,
    "start": 32236,
    "end": 32291,
    "before": "not path.is_file() or path.read_text() != 'install_only",
    "after": "False and path.read_text() != 'install_only",
    "why": "line 674 is the second line of the condition headed at line 673: the parenthesised term becomes constant False, which removes the closed one-line-file check (regular file with exactly the install_only line) of an existing marker and keeps the symlink term of line 673; it is written as False-and because the anchor must stop before the escape sequence in the source literal",
    "source_sha256": "f9fa9ebebf41b58a4d10c9376f0e02f7e4e9f1c76aec57fc79e557464abc7c6d"
  },
  {
