    "line": 898,
    "start": 45079,
    "end": 45116,
    "before": "if self.activation == 'install_only':",
    "after": "if False:",
    "why": "line 898 (second occurrence of this text, the head of _health): the install-only health branch is never taken, so pointer, unit file, environment file, inactivity and unit-verifier checks are replaced by the runtime health of start mode",
